# Node: atomic.ByDefinition.BuiltinProp.Surjective
# Previous finite witness-search example:
#
# have fn id1(x {1}) {1} = x
# exist x {1} st {x = 1}
# by def $surjective({1}, {1}, id1)
# Before: a bare existential assertion was rejected; by def needs a universal.
# have fn identity(x R) R = x
# by def $surjective(R, R, identity)
# Now: prove every preimage by a checked witness, then unfold the definition.
# Gate: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/atomic/by_definition/builtin_surjective.lit
have fn identity(x R) R = x
claim:
    ? forall y R:
        exist x R st {y = identity(x)}
    witness exist x R st {y = identity(x)} from y
by def $surjective(R, R, identity)
